{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10271100","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10271100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1027110001:1":{"text":"地面に轍（わだち）の痕がたくさん……古いのもあるので、ダミアンは以前もここに来ていたようですね。","source_cn":"地上有不少车辙印，新旧交织……看来达米安不是第一次来这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FD69F89081580FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1027110002:1":{"text":"それに、人けの無い所にもかかわらず、罠がいっぱい仕掛けてありますよ。","source_cn":"而且，这么偏僻的地方，还布置了不少机关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F59C5A39FF137AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1027110002":{"text":"それに、人けの無い所にもかかわらず、罠がいっぱい仕掛けてありますよ。","source_cn":"而且，这么偏僻的地方，还布置了不少机关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F59C5A39FF137AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1027110003:1":{"text":"ますます怪しいですね！","source_cn":"——那就更可疑了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29DE6C1C6A7715DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027110004:1":{"text":"なぜこんな所に友人を呼ぶのでしょう？まさか他人を罠の実験台に……","source_cn":"为什么要约朋友在这种地方见面？他该不会是想找人来实验陷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF96335AF53B3765","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title